```sql
SELECT biz_time,
       dt,
       hm,
       SUM(unit_capacity) AS online_capacity_mw,
       COUNT(DISTINCT unit_name) AS online_unit_count
FROM (
  SELECT t1.biz_time,
         t1.dt,
         t1.hm,
         t1.unit_name,
         t3.unit_capacity
  FROM ext_prod_catalog.ods.ods_mkt_anhui_unit_status_d96_p_di t1
  LEFT JOIN ext_prod_catalog.ods.ods_gen_anhui_max_gen_capability_df t3
    ON t1.unit_name = t3.trd_unit_name
   AND SUBSTR(t1.dt, 1, 7) = t3.dt
  WHERE t1.unit_status = '开机'
    AND t1.dt >= '2025-09-01'
) t
GROUP BY biz_time, dt, hm
ORDER BY biz_time;
```

映射到本设计后，查询目标为 `pm_{region_code}_unit_status_curve`。正式构造数据中建议提前完成机组实体映射，避免在业务查询 SQL 中写复杂字符串匹配逻辑。

